# Tooling scratch folders, not project content.
.impeccable/

# Third-party reference PDFs. Kept on disk because several open questions can
# only be closed by reading them, and deliberately kept out of history: they
# are re-downloadable and mostly not ours to redistribute.
# refs/ holds NASA-CR-2144, NASA-CR-114494 (Hanke & Nordwall, Boeing
# D6-30643, the nonlinear 747 model), Caughey MAE5070, Doyle et al. 2011,
# Oseguera & Bowles 1988, Proctor, Hinton & Bowles 2000, and MIL-F-8785C.
refs/
Flight_Dynamics_-_Second_Edition.pdf

# Reference_papers/ follows the same rule as refs/ from session 31 on, and did
# not before: seven publisher-copyrighted documents were tracked, in a PUBLIC
# repository, until that session adjudicated all 24 against their own printed
# copyright statements. DENY BY DEFAULT, then re-include only what is verified
# redistributable. Reference_papers/SOURCES.md is the index: what each document
# is, its md5, and where to fetch the ones that are not here.
#
# Before adding a PDF here, read its own copyright page. A US Government work,
# or one printing the Title 17 "no copyright is asserted in the United States"
# statement, may be re-included below with the basis named. Anything else --
# INCLUDING anything whose licence you could not establish -- stays ignored.
# Rule 2 applies to a licence exactly as it applies to a coefficient: flag,
# never invent.
Reference_papers/**/*.pdf
Reference_papers/**/*.zip

# NASA, US Government work. TM-102186 (Wingrove & Bach): Figs. 6, 7 and 8, read
# by digitise_tm102186_fig6.py and digitise_hannibal_horizontal_wind.py.
!Reference_papers/19890016606.pdf
# Printed: "U.S. Government and therefore is in the public domain." Parks et al.
# 1985, J. Aircraft 22(2): r0, V0 and spacing, and Fig. 6's altitude trace, read
# by digitise_parks_fig6_altitude.py.
!Reference_papers/parks-1985-identification-of-vortex-induced-clear-air-turbulence-JA22-2.pdf
# Printed: "no copyright is asserted in the United States under Title 17, U.S.
# Code." Mehta 1987 -- the five-vortex Hannibal field itself.
!Reference_papers/mehta-2012-modeling-clear-air-turbulence-with-vortices-using-parameter-identification-techniques.pdf
# Printed: the same Title 17 statement. Bach & Parks 1987 -- the error budget.
!Reference_papers/bach-parks-1987-angle-of-attack-estimation-JA24-11.pdf
# Printed: "Approved for public release, distribution unlimited." USAF HICAT.
!Reference_papers/AFFDL-TR-70-101-Ashburn-Waco-Melvin-1970-HICAT-AD878415.pdf
# Printed: "and is not subject to copyright protection in the United States."
!Reference_papers/Ger/schultz-2012-multiple-vortex-ring-model-of-the-dfw-microburst.pdf
# NASA, US Government work, NTRS 19910009769.
!Reference_papers/Xiao_ger/19910009769.pdf
